{"id": "DfFI_d0xNV_", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Vidur ke andar Yamraj kyun the? Ek bachpan ki galti, ek sooli, aur ek rishi ka shraap. Agli kahani ke liye follow karo.\n\nMahabharat, Adi Parva, adhyay 107-108. Rishi Mandavya maun vrat mein the. Chor raja ka maal unke ashram mein chhupa gaye, aur sipahiyon ne rishi ko bhi chor maan liya.\n\nRaja ne unhe sooli di. Tapasya ke bal par wo zinda rahe. Sooli kaati gayi, par uski nok (ani) sharir mein reh gayi, isliye naam pada Ani-Mandavya.\n\nDharmraj Yama ne bataya, bachpan mein unhone keedon ko tinke se chubhoya tha. Rishi ne kaha, bachpan ki galti ki itni badi saza? Shraap diya, aur niyam banaya ki 14 saal se chhote bachche ki galti paap nahi ginee jaayegi.\n\nIsi shraap se Yamraj ne Vidur bankar janm liya.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Episode 3. Part 1 aur 2 profile par hain.\n\n#mahabharata #vidur #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793281447, "like_count": 4828, "comment_count": 33, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4069412300028304a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.592, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQONHNR4QYm-zDgzSsagyONFRQ55TC6Aja30S4EyTJX3Xtre3q6pVi0b1yfg4mtF3LRX-ZADlEubosgzTx86WRYmXXY38VRgj69UGGs.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdpKuhMjouxSnYuEl81u75BzKSftXGwhXApcMbHFXvbO7nnt43RUijkOeIz9C_YqyFseTOnRaXiifN8V4PJVoGId&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=i7T9gdjeB_IQ7kNvwFKwpKY&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=6ablqgQRwBX9idAVn3fq6A&_n